{"id": 48, "ts": 1780441775.4577038, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate the points raised about Candidate\u202fB\u2019s strong technical skills and stress handling, but I remain uneasy about the reports of him being grumpy and uncooperative. Crew cooperation is essential for long\u2011distance operations, and an uncooperative pilot can jeopardize cockpit resource management. In contrast, Candidate\u202fD demonstrates a solid record on several safety\u2011critical dimensions: he responds adequately to unexpected events, concentrates very well, solves problems extremely well, and takes responsibility seriously. These strengths directly support operational reliability, stress resilience, and decision quality on long\u2011haul flights. While D\u2019s arrogance and weaker leadership are noted concerns, they are less detrimental than a tendency to resist teamwork, and they can be mitigated through targeted leadership coaching. Therefore, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fD as the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
