ucation,\u201d limiting adaptability and teamwork.\nThus, Candidate\u202fD offers the strongest overall combination of operational reliability, stress resilience, technical competence, and responsibility, with manageable weaknesses that can be addressed through targeted development. This makes D the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot position."}
